{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1000_p", "source_sha256": "95110b4bb5ae3cb9deb86778710b2d0ce08513b6ae485677e1429398ba2038ef", "ja": "（今日は『魔法学園』シリーズの撮影日。\n今回は桃子とやよい、ふたりが演じる先生だ）", "zh": "（今天是《魔法学园》系列的拍摄日。这次是桃子和弥生两人饰演的老师。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1001_p", "source_sha256": "24123440ab34451463273151f9774297e08ebf146137ab1b6009022fe178eb9b", "ja": "（桃子は元々やよいの教え子で、\n過去、命を救われた事がある……そういう設定だ）", "zh": "（桃子原本就是弥生的学生，过去还曾被她救过性命……设定就是这样。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "f1d46750c12c3b8e790c5694fb2352f66c9c45d5f8f2cd13c0c691a625fd78e5", "ja": "ふぅ。……まあ、私のことをよく思わない生徒が\nいるなんて、そんなのわかってたことだよね。", "zh": "呼。……会有不喜欢我的学生，这种事我早就知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "e7896280dab5c8aa1b8fe0225c3fae510f7b02cdfe6570168f2f49e6918eda2f", "ja": "……やよい先生に、会いに行こうかな。", "zh": "……去找一下弥生老师吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f2edf0ec802ccf77b4c861fcadbc24ce892230c3489eaa57c74ebe63893d63b4", "ja": "お疲れ様、桃子。\n監督が褒めてたよ。「迫真の演技だ！」って。", "zh": "辛苦了，桃子。\n导演夸你了，说：“演技真是栩栩如生！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "670d0d038cb8dd6a21aa2f71a9e056879778eed382096fcf000515fd82a77cc8", "ja": "ふふん、当然だよ。桃子はプロだもん！\nリアルな演技なんて、できて当たり前……", "zh": "哼哼，那当然啦。桃子可是专业的嘛！\n能演出逼真的感觉，本来就是理所当然的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "a9614682a5043c3a09d8844ea2f6b985c1a3178cae80397ad2c95e7383a7f003", "ja": "……なんだけど。\n今回だけは、そういうことじゃないのかも。", "zh": "……不过。\n也许只有这次，情况并不是那样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a3cdacda45e2b63e0cc59ac4244b0eecba5d02becb9293873fd82d107aab27b2", "ja": "桃子先生は、学生の時に危険な魔法に手を出して、\nやよい先生に助けてもらった……って事だったな。", "zh": "桃子老师在学生时代曾涉足危险的魔法，后来得到了弥生老师的帮助……是这么回事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "dec1622f68ef9a577e8d8135d42fb4fb237d14ce38b0e9fe6c44dded1d47555c", "ja": "うん。\n……『桃子』はたぶん、後悔してると思うんだ。", "zh": "嗯。\n……我想，“桃子”应该是在后悔吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "c7e43379dd221653aa059747a2c3e5d48047571c6be6868e2449a644f537935e", "ja": "強がって、背伸びばっかりして。周りの人達を\n見返したくって、危ない魔法に興味を持って……。", "zh": "总是逞强，一直在硬撑。想让身边的人\n另眼相看，结果对危险的魔法产生了兴趣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "ff4603f671d85d48562ef585d04e97be84cb996dd005beec19d3effcb7e029ca", "ja": "周りの人が止めてくれてたはずなのに。誰のことも\n信じなくて。話も、聞けてなかったんだと思う。", "zh": "明明周围的人都劝阻过我才对。可我谁也不相信。\n而且我觉得，自己当时连别人说的话都没听进去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "5f67a2f3dce609fbe10fede5e0790ab849939e86f00995c232eeab90aeaf39e8", "ja": "ね？　誰かさんにそっくりでしょ。", "zh": "对吧？和某个人一模一样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "b4469a16afcdb3a87c0e643c3f5478615edce347a9fd986297823d8df869f5c9", "ja": "だから、この役が上手なんて、\n桃子には当たり前なんだよ。", "zh": "所以，桃子擅长这个角色是理所当然的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1014_p", "source_sha256": "18fcfba7aac36c837a124013bafa8dc29b72cf9459b08e20f4a826b9fb8d5fd4", "ja": "……桃子がこの役に共感したのはわかったよ。\nでも監督が褒めてたのは、そこだけじゃないからな？", "zh": "……桃子对这个角色产生了共鸣，这点我明白了。\n但导演夸奖的，可不只是那一点哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1016_p", "source_sha256": "16eb3b6073652a7222a0162d9033b9386a2a216e8055afa262f54204e3505792", "ja": "陰口を叩かれても腐らず、しっかり前を向いて進む。\nそういう芯の強さが、すごく伝わってきたって。", "zh": "即使被人在背后说坏话，也不气馁，坚定地向前走。那种坚强的内心，让人深深感受到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5bc6f8605217b7a194a498e0d2582ed34b7642b93f62abc234e562944701fe18", "ja": "良かったな、桃子。", "zh": "太好了，桃子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "46965a7cc7a734c00cb1bf1caa8e09f045c579062326088e91ce7036147c272f", "ja": "……ふふっ。そんなの、トーゼンだよ！\n桃子先生には、パートナーのやよい先生がいるからね。", "zh": "……呵呵。那当然啦！\n毕竟桃子老师身边，可是有搭档弥生老师在呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "e544a66bad5d4d6c23cf3b57b2ad7265569998dd0163d0aee75fa3f4d53c9a23", "ja": "信じてくれる人が、そばにいるんだもん。\nだからもう、何も怖くないんだよ。桃子もね！", "zh": "因为身边有相信我的人嘛。\n所以已经什么都不怕了。桃子也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1020_p", "source_sha256": "7e2ecdff44a4cfa8f45335d3f958b79c5cac4e5b5118ffebbdfdc03457062db3", "ja": "そうか。\nうん、そうだよな。", "zh": "这样啊。\n嗯，确实是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "cbb6f718d2cdf5dbcb145997beaad8743936d77b8c126b06ca0354f1f540ca00", "ja": "そうだよ！　それに、やよい先生だけじゃなくて、\n学園の他のみんなだっているし……。", "zh": "没错！而且不只是弥生老师，\n学院里的其他大家也都在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1022_049mom", "source_sha256": "1aed3694f452c67660ef92c73167dcc3d84bfedebde5f3dbec82c774048a2f09", "ja": "それと。他人事みたいに言ってるけど、\n桃子にとってはお兄ちゃんもだよ。わかってる？", "zh": "还有，虽然你说得像是在说别人的事，但对桃子来说，哥哥也是其中一员哦。明白了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1023_p", "source_sha256": "da3d965eff9edffd1e9c1cf3cf6bd7eb5fd680d651bab00fb41f77e805f27097", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\n大丈夫、わかってるよ！", "zh": "嗯，也是啊。\n放心，我都明白的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0734_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "dab85f129c8911a95c298c668262e58ce7667e2d58e642ed3c207c1dbbc85db4", "ja": "そう。なら、もうこの話はおしまい！　桃子、\nなんだかノドが渇いちゃった。ジュース買ってきて！", "zh": "好。那这件事就到此为止！桃子，\n我突然有点渴了。去买果汁回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
